[{"op":"background","image":"kuro"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"background","image":"bg021ac"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"set","target":["v","z",314],"value":1},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"正在上课──…。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"（…那是啥…？）"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我和往常一样眺望着窗外，对上课内容左耳进右耳出。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"开始上课之后，本该已经没有人通行的校门附近。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"有着那么一个…算是什么东西呢…？"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"那东西一动一动的，多半是个动物，但我又想不起有什么动物长成这样。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"说是猫呢，太大…。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"说是狗呢，太圆…。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"说是狸猫…尾巴又太短了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"（…身上的斑纹也很独特…）"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"也不知算竖纹还是什么…。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"总而言之，这个大概是动物的东西，正兴奋地用它的脸…？蹭着校门。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"它走动时四条腿扑腾的样子，还挺可爱的。"},{"op":"background","image":"bg080c"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"叮咚叮咚…。"},{"op":"background","image":"bg018c"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh10"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「冈崎，你去哪啊？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「有个地方我想去看看。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「好玩儿的地方？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「大概会挺无聊的。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh11"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「那我也去。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「你只会碍事，还是别跟来了。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh20"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「别这么说嘛。我一个人在教室里也很无聊的。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「你…还真是没朋友啊。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh23"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「你没资格说我！」"},{"op":"background","image":"bg015c"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"set","target":["v","z",322],"value":1},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「我想想…应该就在这附近…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"也不知是不是到别处去了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我实在是很好奇那究竟是什么动物，可惜了…。"},{"op":"set","target":["v","f",1118],"value":1},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh19"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「你是在找东西吗？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「也不能算是吧…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"蹭蹭…蹭蹭…。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「嗯…？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我的脚踝附近有什么东西…。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgbt10"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"？？","text":"「噗噗。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「………」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"蹭蹭…蹭蹭…。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh27"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「喂，冈崎…？这什么啊？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgbt10"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"？？","text":"「噗噗。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「我…我哪知道啊？？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"这…这是什么动物啊…？"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"不是狗也不是狸猫…背上还有竖纹的动物…。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"看这个样子，应该还是个幼崽…。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"？？","text":"「噗。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh16"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「太…太可爱了…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「嗯…有一种猫和狗都没有的魅力。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh12"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「我可以摸摸它吗？不会咬我吧？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「不管怎么说，它会过来蹭我应该是没有敌意吧。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「那，那我要摸了，要揉了，要抱了。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"春原向这只小动物伸出手去。"},{"op":"set","target":["v","s",1001],"value":"cgbt13"},{"op":"callScene","scene":9078,"entry":6},{"op":"text","speaker":"？？","text":"「噗…噗噗。」"},{"op":"callScene","scene":9078,"entry":9},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh13"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「你别跑啊ー…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"在他的手即将摸到那可爱小动物背上的时候。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"声","text":"「喂ーーー！！」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh20"]},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"一个熟悉的声音传来，我回过头去。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"就在同时，有个什么东西从我眼前飞过。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"砰！！"},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「哦嚯！」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我朝脚边一看，见是一本日英词典落在地上。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"顺带一提，春原也鼻血长流倒在地上。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh23"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「什么叫『顺带一提』啊！」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「你怎么知道我是这么想的啊。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh16"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「哎哟疼疼疼，为什么会有东西飞过来啊。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「要是打的地方不对，会出人命的好吗。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「话说到底是谁…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「啊…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh19"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「什么呀？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"啪！"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"春原刚要起身，就被飞起一脚。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"他连喊都没有喊出声，就再次被摁进大地之中。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「会很危险的哦。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「你…你早说啊…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"他的手脚兀自抽搐着，对我表示不满。"},{"op":"set","target":["v","s",1001],"value":"cgbt11"},{"op":"callScene","scene":9078,"entry":1},{"op":"text","speaker":"？？","text":"「噗噗♪」"},{"op":"set","target":["v","z",306],"value":1},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky13"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「唉。真是的…你打算对我家宝宝干什么呀。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"压上全身体重对春原发动华丽踢腿的元凶，刷地一捋头发说到。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「…你家宝宝…？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky12"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「对，我的宠物。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「你说的…是这个圆滚滚的东西？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgbt11"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"？？","text":"「噗，噗♪」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky21"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「可爱吧？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「…是新品种的狗或者狸猫？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky26"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「你的眼睛是眼眶里塞个玻璃珠做成的？它看起来哪里像狗和狸猫了？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「那是什么啊？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky11"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「豕仔啊。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「屎仔？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky12"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「不要命了是吧？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「你别笑着说这话啊，我有点怕。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky13"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「是·豕·仔·啦。或者说瓜皮仔这个叫法比较熟悉？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「嗯…好像有听过…是什么东西的幼崽对吧？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky10"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「是野猪的宝宝啦。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgbt15"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"？？","text":"「噗噗。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「………」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky15"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「怎么了？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「当宠物养…？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky25"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「是啊。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「………」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgbt10"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"？？","text":"「噗？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky14"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「你要是有什么话想说，就直接说出来嘛！」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「你认真的？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky13"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「超认真的。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky12"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「啊，你想听听它的名字吗？超级可爱的。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「你倒说说看。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky21"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「它叫牡丹。超级好听的，对吧？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgbt15"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"牡丹","text":"「噗♪」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「听起来还挺好吃…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky12"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「嗯？你再说一遍？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「不…我什么都没说…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh16"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「唔…疼疼…鼻梁疼得像被火燎过一样。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「哟，你起来啦。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh20"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「嗯…话说牡丹火锅怎么了？如果缺味噌，我就得回宿舍一趟了。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「话说刚才我被一脚踹倒的时候，除了脚底好像还看到一丝淡蓝色的东西。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「那一定是内…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky14"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「给我忘掉ー！」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"啪！"},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「唔唔哦哦ーー！」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky20"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「呼呼…你听到了？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「没听到。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我的面前只有这一个选项。"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「话说，你的小野猪来这里干什么？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky10a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「大概是来看我的吧。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"set","target":["v","s",1001],"value":"cgbt11"},{"op":"callScene","scene":9078,"entry":1},{"op":"text","speaker":"牡丹","text":"「噗噗。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「现在还在上课吧。你打算怎么办？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky18a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「也是啊ー…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"set","target":["v","s",1001],"value":"cgbt11"},{"op":"callScene","scene":9078,"entry":1},{"op":"text","speaker":"牡丹","text":"「噗，噗。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky11a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「你听好哦，牡丹。我现在回不去。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgbt10"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"牡丹","text":"「噗。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「所以你要乖乖待在家里。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgbt13"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"牡丹","text":"「噗…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「等我放学就马上回来。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"牡丹","text":"「噗…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky12a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「没事啦。这家伙会负责陪你回家的。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「喂，为什么要指着我啊？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky10a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「这孩子超喜欢散步的，要是不看着点，不知道会走到哪里去。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「所以你就负责看着它。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「啊？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky25a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「反正你也没在听课对吧？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「所以你还不如帮别人做点事来的更有意义不是吗？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「别开玩笑了。我上课可是要睡觉的。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「世界上哪有比这更有意义的事啊。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky12a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「废话少说。要是你肯去，今天午饭我请你。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「包在我身上。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我拍着胸脯爽快地答应了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「说起来…我不认识你家啊。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky11a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「啊ー，放心吧。牡丹会为你带路的。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「你只要当心车辆，玻璃还有面包店那个凶巴巴的大叔就行了。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「要是这家伙有个三长两短怎么办？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky12"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「啊哈哈哈ー，这还用问吗？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「你的寿命就只好缩短一大截啦。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"真希望她别总若无其事地说出这么凶险的话…。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「午饭我随便吃什么都可以？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky11"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「只要食堂有的都行。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「你可别忘了这个约定哦。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「只要你能在我离开学校前回来就行。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「好，那我们走吧小野猪！」"},{"op":"set","target":["v","s",1001],"value":"cgbt10"},{"op":"callScene","scene":9078,"entry":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"牡丹","text":"「噗！」"},{"op":"set","target":["v","s",1001],"value":"cgbt11"},{"op":"callScene","scene":9078,"entry":7},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"嘚嘚嘚嘚嘚～"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「跑的还挺快？！」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky12"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「喂，当心别被它甩掉。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「好，倒在地上那个家伙就麻烦你收拾了。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky11"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「再过５分钟就会醒的。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「说的也是啊。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"牡丹","text":"『噗ー噗ー』"},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「好啦，它都在喊你了。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「唉，我的午饭你给我站住！」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky14"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「不许说这么吓人的话！」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「不是差不多吗ー！」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我一边喊着一边朝跑在前头的小动物追去。"},{"op":"background","image":"kuro"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「…丢了…」"},{"op":"set","target":["v","z",322],"value":1},{"op":"background","image":"bg031c"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"跑了几分钟，我就完美地把小野猪追丢了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「这可…不好办了…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"现在已经没空去想让杏请我吃午饭的事了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"明明这么小一只，怎么跑得这么快啊…。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"希望它孤身一人…不对，孤身一猪也能安全到家…。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「哎，也只能这么去想了。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"毕竟我也不觉得真能找得到。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"总之随便逛逛打发下时间，然后回学校吧。"},{"op":"background","image":"kuro"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"background","image":"bg018c"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"第四节课和班会都已经结束，除了有社团活动的人，其他人都已经回家了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"老天保祐，别给杏撞见…。"},{"op":"set","target":["v","f",1118],"value":0},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky15"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「啊。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「啧…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky12"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「你回来啦，有把牡丹安全送回家吗？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「当，当然了。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「这样啊，谢啦。那约定就是约定，我请你吃午饭。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky11"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「哦，我想我之前也说过了，只限食堂有卖的哦。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「不不，我想了想还是算了。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky15"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「嗯？为什么？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「我回来路上肚子饿了，就买了点东西吃。所以这次就不用了。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky25"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「这次不用…我可没说改天还请你吃哦。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「那就算了吧。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky26"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「总觉得…你不太对劲…？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「总，总之就算了吧。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky15"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「哦…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我背对着杏，像是逃命一般沿着走廊跑了。"},{"op":"return"},{"op":"return"}]